# ---- submission bundle: keep the files its README advertises ----
# The *.pptx / *.zip / *.npz rules above exist to keep decks, archives and the
# 3.5 GB of preprocessed PSG out of git. These four are small deliverables the
# MMNet_Submission README lists, so they are re-included explicitly.
!MMNet_research/MMNet_Submission/MM_Net_presentation.pptx
!MMNet_research/MMNet_Submission/paper/multimodal_source_overleaf.zip
!MMNet_research/MMNet_Submission/all_codes/results/npz/predictions.npz
!MMNet_research/MMNet_Submission/all_codes/results/npz/event_labels.npz

# the assembled upload folder — the zip is the Overleaf project itself
!FINAL_SUBMISSION/01_Overleaf_Project.zip
